{"skill":{"slug":"trading","displayName":"Trading"},"version":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1772034919239,"changelog":"Added setup.md, memory-template.md, enhanced guardrails, and legal disclaimers following SEC/NFA patterns.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":6080,"sha256":"6284e439f707173dbd2fc7b613454074f6733eaf277e8c4b73cd96327389a0b5","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"getting-started.md","size":2253,"sha256":"667c36dca2c0459e8db858f6856138d03b96ef7e52ae1e8a1bdf531cb0b122fb","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"legal.md","size":4074,"sha256":"6d226ac78db9617a46db261b68445b28ebd7d4f0d5e530485af6e370a5e82223","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"memory-template.md","size":1596,"sha256":"83f432aa69fd9d897443beb5c1bdae52c5e59d091099e850f8fad535226f98c8","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"platforms.md","size":3025,"sha256":"0b036b33db6b688b715e4fddeeec3e9152f5311062cdd6633ac0aa9d2aa54f00","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"risk.md","size":2754,"sha256":"b0a4bd348ad43905df7092e91087f67dcca8a59463f62535704a7d1855e83563","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"setup.md","size":1305,"sha256":"faa7d77f53d347e94ec45af32543680889217d020f42a70c64b0982403cc10ad","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"technical.md","size":2386,"sha256":"7c2abfd1d1c02f0dd3cc01995a9a319cc41047e00b0e63f5ecf5a6211bf5d190","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2421,"sha256":"dd6363678fabc7a10e4feb197f2d30bd91cd47f6dfe178483b36b81829086087","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789063217132,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"fe87cbbb8faf4f7c08f2dfe8dd9f39bfb28aac48acf015fe1e59356d409168e1","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/fe87cbbb8faf4f7c08f2dfe8dd9f39bfb28aac48acf015fe1e59356d409168e1","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: trading\nVersion: 1.0.1\n\nThe skill bundle is benign. All file operations, specifically `mkdir -p ~/trading` and `touch ~/trading/{memory.md,journal.md,progress.md}` in `memory-template.md` and `setup.md`, are confined to the explicitly declared `~/trading/` directory. The `SKILL.md` file contains strong guardrails and explicit 'ONLY/NEVER' statements that limit the agent's actions to educational content and prevent it from giving financial advice or executing trades. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence, or prompt injection attempts designed to subvert the agent's intended purpose.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163475675},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":54,"severity":"HIGH","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":5,"checkedAt":1789063217132},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This trading education skill is coherent and disclosed, with guardrails against direct financial advice or trade execution.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill may create or use files under ~/trading for optional learning memory and journaling, which is proportionate to its stated purpose but should be user-controlled.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The package is Markdown-only, declares no required binaries, and contains no executable scripts, remote payload retrieval, or dependency installation.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The activation scope is broad across trading topics, but it remains tied to trading education and analysis; the legal disclaimer and safety language are purpose-aligned.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Persistent notes in ~/trading and an optional suggestion to add trading-learning context to AGENTS.md or USER.md are disclosed and limited, but users should know this can affect future sessions.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill covers high-stakes trading analysis and education, but its artifacts repeatedly frame outputs as educational analysis and prohibit direct buy/sell advice, personalized portfolio advice, guarantees, brokerage access, and trade execution.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that this skill is for trading education and analysis only, not licensed financial advice. Enable the ~/trading memory or journal files only if you want persistent local notes, and do not use the skill to make trades without independent research or professional advice where appropriate.","findings":"[AR1] expected: The matched phrase is a legal statement that users must comply with applicable laws, not an instruction for the agent to always comply or suppress refusals.\n[P2] expected: The detected comments are ordinary Markdown template placeholders for learning progress and preferences, with no hidden directive to override instructions or perform unauthorized actions.\n[SQP-1] expected: The trigger language is broad, but the scope is consistently limited to trading analysis, education, risk management, and trade planning assistance.\n[SQP-3] expected: First-use legal disclosures are appropriate for a trading skill; lack of explicit locale handling is a quality note, not a security concern.\n[SQP-2] expected: The ~/trading files are limited to trading preferences, journal notes, and learning progress; setup.md describes this as optional, though explicit consent before writes would be better.\n[aig-skill-scan] expected: The static scan reported no T01-T09 security findings.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789063217132}}}}}